utcomes </c><00:00:05.960><c>or </c><00:00:05.963><c>introduce  </c><00:00:05.966><c>predictability </c><00:00:05.969><c>the </c><00:00:05.972><c>entropy </c><00:00:05.975><c>must </c><00:00:05.978><c>go </c><00:00:05.981><c>down  </c><00:00:05.984><c>now </c><00:00:05.987><c>the </c><00:00:05.990><c>fundamental </c><00:00:05.993><c>idea </c><00:00:05.996><c>is </c><00:00:05.999><c>that </c><00:00:06.002><c>if </c><00:00:06.005><c>the  </c><00:00:06.008><c>entropy </c><00:00:06.011><c>of </c><00:00:06.014><c>an </c><00:00:06.017><c>information </c><00:00:06.020><c>source </c><00:00:06.023><c>drops  </c><00:00:06.026><c>that </c><00:00:06.029><c>means </c><00:00:06.032><c>we </c><00:00:06.035><c>can </c><00:00:06.038><c>ask </c><00:00:06.041><c>fewer </c><00:00:06.044><c>questions </c><00:00:06.047><c>to  </c><00:00:06.050><c>guess </c><00:00:06.053><c>the </c><00:00:06.056><c>outcome </c><00:00:06.059><c>and </c><00:00:06.062><c>thanks </c><00:00:06.065><c>to </c><00:00:06.068><c>Shannon  </c><00:00:06.071><c>the </c><00:00:06.074><c>bit </c><00:00:06.077><c>which </c><00:00:06.080><c>is </c><00:00:06.083><c>the </c><00:00:06.086><c>unit </c><00:00:06.089><c>of </c><00:00:06.092><c>entropy </c><00:00:06.095><c>is  </c><00:00:06.098><c>adopted </c><00:00:06.101><c>as </c><00:00:06.104><c>our </c><00:00:06.107><c>quantitative </c><00:00:06.110><c>measure </c><00:00:06.113><c>of  </c><00:00:06.116><c>information </c><00:00:06.119><c>or </c><00:00:06.122><c>measure </c><00:00:06.125><c>of </c><00:00:06.128><c>surprise</c>

